{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10014_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:940355e64d168615be3e1de1aa8c430da0df0ee5b02e0f8eb4197e800480d62a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dda369c0851bb1f68c7bf9e7f3a79b81364299201fd899c64c71740e68fcbf01",
      "text": "帅气哥哥养成指南",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b9a777e6cd7d25d8ba642515f5859532e883c80dbc63c64c54a9e47188c3034",
      "text": "在面向小学生的电视节目中，W被选拔为体操\n哥哥。参演的小朋友前来向悠介和享介请教：\n“我就要当哥哥了，想成为帅气的哥哥”，\n两人面对这样的烦恼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000015:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000015:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dda369c0851bb1f68c7bf9e7f3a79b81364299201fd899c64c71740e68fcbf01",
      "text": "帅气哥哥养成指南",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b061118aa7ce44e83b87c48b06ed9fa2a6ca3097b066ebcdf8e5ca7ef3675f26",
      "text": "（趁着热身运动，顺便把新歌记下来吧～\n戴上耳机）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:625ef79328a2b4c14775649dbe5b616d632a5d8a956d3d781b760c46bd9717ae",
      "text": "（《VIVA!!家庭律动》真是一首让人忍不住想动起身体\n的歌啊。用来做准备运动也再合适不过了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44de469c9ed965894488e1be14a77d70a3312e8468db4be88a2d6523913a5a0e",
      "text": "（深吸一口气，然后慢慢呼出来……\n首先轻轻地Jump！这样♪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dc888f68a5a0a9ce900c9c8691162d40b29123490b4dfa70ce90269c29bb36b",
      "text": "喂——悠介。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203a3fe08d2aebb12865821f0d3ffc5555be42985f72c5fa80cd07c89c63148d",
      "text": "（嗯？享介在叫我？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91f83872b714e947bcb593da178f31e73ea1e5d456426c49ff15d684c820bdea",
      "text": "怎么啦？有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c6143f70b418c63309ae88b8afee23cf2b405108958ee29d0c62f1b22af6891",
      "text": "你现在听的，是我们的新歌吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf5a04606583051120fa8a2c17923b0e1d85145ca911419c0e96cff7f7efb731",
      "text": "答对啦！真亏你能看出来啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d6d67ac3b6ed2af16a6cd9a9a9c6248b70c679db80936f6bb1cbc26a9be1c75",
      "text": "因为你的动作和歌词一模一样啊。\n我也想早点记住这首歌，能把声音放出来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_a:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:010c0516563e75d7b61ddce6ddf8ae3c476d1ce1a76f37165d626d16634982f8",
      "text": "没问题！\n那我放歌啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:150cf7004730a0d0640fb5937c5f5182649bcb49fdaa853651bbdca5af477d08",
      "text": "录制当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:057d83df6b1ba6f50183068e8cf043690213f23909fee64622e30717dc8113a8",
      "text": "大家，下午好！从今天起体操大哥哥就由\nW的苍井悠介来担任啦。请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4c1f9615c1ba2703a568dad25e3f7ebe3b7c54ad301a848ebb88825c6b3cc57",
      "text": "大家好！我是苍井享介。\n虽然只有短短的时间，但请大家多多关照啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03cfca6b4c1f3a2ee9942808c6e5a4d7b9ac2399a34e24c9cfb093432f9ba2fe",
      "text": "请——多——关——照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41904a1cc5cbbab00f8f8468f248b6d44ccecbe2aa044cfa51e9b38a18592f4e",
      "text": "我们是双胞胎，很难分清吧？\n所以，不戴眼镜的我就是悠介。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bb130776a4e9ed745b74794538e732b8849600026769e43c5006a4b109c1e35",
      "text": "戴着眼镜的我是享介，能记住吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a",
      "text": "好——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f06d3a3a56f9188b561df1f1eed5f6ea9f9f7c76c3a8fc28e349e0d7a316045",
      "text": "那么接下来，大家能不能跟我说说自己的事情呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aae954ca76047c1022534f23adf5d5890cd15a38102339899366e3c99d5a3992",
      "text": "好的！我喜欢赛跑！\n经常和学校里的朋友比试哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bae93fdab7387806b4ecc74aa389e7560cc7c5bfa87fcc79a62e08810cd5cf65",
      "text": "很棒嘛！\n待会儿跑给我看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05fdb9364671bc8d08dbe75f8cd7b40fe49444852b6f004aa88bd6a02f7dfba8",
      "text": "我长大了想当学校的老师！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:075445aaf2fcfb683414e60442351057cfc476792b5c4feb479a6ce4b06c16d7",
      "text": "那是个很棒的梦想呢！\n我会支持你实现的。加油哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:953ba715ce74abb508c37e37cf000a27faafd5e2e5aaddad7d32039d8122f348",
      "text": "我马上就要当哥哥了！\n听说要有小弟弟或小妹妹出生了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c1fad65fceb645f6b753729265db9ad490639136bb173b0e96cdb1b96cc6a7d",
      "text": "哎呀，要有弟妹了啊。\n那可真让人期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_b:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0636141a1d505ec0ac946a6cf2729c227256e14671a76d1cae1272c9dace84d3",
      "text": "关于当哥哥的事情，随时都可以来问我哦！\n说不定我能教你几招呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d5754fd4a959fe87095fb74f51cfb26f566b3a3108de3f4f85b3a6274589b8e",
      "text": "录制辛苦了！\n到下一次开始之前，先稍微休息一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5147312ea0dedf4514b477d19cc38c52da996262fbb509b1650ec238b9c3f07",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●监督也辛苦了。\n悠介，下次最后的定点姿势选什么主题？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a926e0491f2bace2e5e980848ce8427a5ecde2dd8ffa5db7dfea8592683e840",
      "text": "也跟孩子们商量看看吧。\n我也想快点和他们打成一片嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6109bd2d05d6360bcecf65ea0145d5f42b01da6c3702560142e118f9fbaf4ec",
      "text": "悠介君、享介君！\n辛苦了。那个，现在方便吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:340e4169fc24353c1b9c21a46328e56a5c90f54b206676e769103aa4771f43fb",
      "text": "你是……刚才说马上就要当哥哥的\n那个孩子对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd43f1a196bad8392ceb1b7862edbb5bb3579bcf6b87255c7e64985456c7db1",
      "text": "嗯。悠介君之前说，当哥哥的事随时可以来问，\n所以我就过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82e2095dff33a27da6957da319ede8402437e1bdbf2f21f683b3c37062f02eff",
      "text": "我想在弟弟或妹妹出生前，变成帅气的\n哥哥！要怎么做才能变成那样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f10e051333c71cd1f0508f7d655e0164f768c566795ef55868fa7a320b0a458",
      "text": "原来如此。既然这样，那就交给从出生开始就一直\n当享介哥哥的我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:169bac2cc80ab727aacb9210d3876bc5188d24cabb7719ccfe0904f08a86f8a2",
      "text": "哇啊，谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46989c5975378b2c62129d54f1451c8dd940fb117be112e6816c7e3be14c9716",
      "text": "既然是来向两位请教的，我就先回避一下吧。\n有什么事请随时联系我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:380a0cf692537743a68702f78b2ee9ecbfae1ec00e68445d7ec27630dd49ad08",
      "text": "嗯，知道了。\n谢谢●●●●●●●●●●监督。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c0f4877cd379e5cec4c4a006ceec0c060e2948323cb3b50a9eb989696bd5526",
      "text": "悠介要教怎么当哥哥的话，那我就来教从弟弟\n视角看怎样的哥哥才算帅气，怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d4a143d9dd9d7afe010aec2adec279d891c04b41cb1a33d93ba8a907d672f2a",
      "text": "哎，什么啊，我现在就想听！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35fd2564889aec42ef937886fcf0e17182b6df19276836ca9d5bcf090a0a8a06",
      "text": "等会儿再说啦。悠介你觉得帅气的哥哥是什么样的，\n应该先讲这个吧？请正牌哥哥先讲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7155a85c9eddc4a65eb54a762a781be0148c3c4bfa0ccd5d391b2e975a3b4159",
      "text": "我觉得帅气的哥哥，\n主要有这两点吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f1dc08f40bb7cda93799807695a128ab45547ee6d5d46a5d0005646e416bb83",
      "text": "对方在为喜欢的事情努力时，\n要给予大力的支持和加油。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b14ac7fbec39eb99aeed3117e0118f8e28ff8619c6055b26eafab7213bf19c9b",
      "text": "虽然还不知道是弟弟还是妹妹，\n但要是觉得对方有困难了，就要马上去帮忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6e715b119c942279b5f7a60a12793bf5117511fb9b9790c39f9e473a8673a23",
      "text": "那种时候作为哥哥，\n只要展现出可靠的一面就搞定啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:caaa7cde6f7198c8cc5b76d6407b34b2dd3033bb2002f0572f203d00283eabd2",
      "text": "加油……遇到困难时帮忙……\n知道了，我会努力的！还有别的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ff47aca587dfd39bb9e1f8f4d25c925c9f7d4ea62ee41535a6bd23acf8d6ec1",
      "text": "这个嘛～如果有全心投入的事情，\n可能会显得很帅气哦。比如喜欢的东西之类的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84b6821190f74be9ab7a289df9cf6b6a3553631a543acbb9129259cec7329ee4",
      "text": "你有这样的东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b87da980f4fb6b118c4da7b5db19b089bb9c22770b06b97cbad823dd3f0201eb",
      "text": "有的！我最喜欢踢足球了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5062019f123ef298f0026043abd641c37ab26f5be2cc963687601f5ef29a79e9",
      "text": "哦！是吗？我们也超喜欢\n足球的哦。对吧，享介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:466a9373e670cb7dd49ddb6d406bba3a5841260f3422f8b37fcd8e422568745b",
      "text": "喜欢同一样东西，真让人开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d740512164419c9bd51319a3014f37f14a83d1bc0d02c09bdab9af4aacbb9463",
      "text": "我也是！\n不过，我才刚开始学踢足球。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cc3b4cead83725f4ff697450427a2e5e25e0ab7797daa7c1bee59d685b18ead",
      "text": "踢得还不好，\n可能没办法展现出帅气的一面……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bd656d380fa97dc7bc07277a6802e7a92a73fa407eddb89e3e8cee452b3e1fb",
      "text": "那我就教你除了足球之外，\n马上就能做到的事情吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e74125502d2711024b3ac0c0a829f7b224a1b4ae58903354ef64c3f890d3d812",
      "text": "是什么，是什么。快告诉我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a0c37d2cc0a3fdfe131ca11d8edfca91ee4c4ab92af07d686b65ccac72874a3",
      "text": "那就是，如果有讨厌吃的东西，哥哥就\n帮着吃掉！这个很重要哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0495f52174a4d842dcd46956510d648d68f5fadac1238f11ae56eeeabfb7d72",
      "text": "那样的话，我也许能做到！我会加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25891649cb506a6acdd8cc584acc3b0cb7ae5aaa47c9c85f5a05710b75ef9c2d",
      "text": "顺便一提，我今天也把享介讨厌吃的胡萝卜\n给吃掉了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8431cc7ec660a8fd0f0172598db1092056e47fd499bda404ec55510c4f0a36b1",
      "text": "这个也要说吗？作为交换，\n你不是把自己讨厌吃的青椒偷偷塞给我了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06918bc638012c4c6f9168792d7b7f192d38e28efcbe8c4b36e1e8d13936094f",
      "text": "哎呀，那个就不用特地讲出来了啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71bc1c326ec29547fa2d086454127035a6ad5a180faa84c75ec12abf612bbfac",
      "text": "这种事实还是要说清楚的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ad50f3cb31ab4668bcf72fa6de169540673829eab07d961f27e99888383ed0c",
      "text": "（这、应该不是在吵架吧……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0811b36a3193d16906bd1ad252b5c66d004dc4eb53a4992d07e018988f766334",
      "text": "辛苦了！我们会按原定计划重新开始录制，\n稍后请各位移步现场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d",
      "text": "啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb4407678f2ef52392bbb7b1ef4486a796051f65ba2fef844d005ea2ca399b9c",
      "text": "好的！……悠介，我先过去了。\n时间还充裕，你们两个慢慢过来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_e:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3d62491191659e07c6c15e428412c9cd48214a3a5d22ccd746ccdd11d155f13",
      "text": "哦，谢啦。\n那么，待会儿见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00674212cabbabd7d21f351d73c7b8d619d002da16a540d3fcacd3d731e9defb",
      "text": "那我们再聊一会儿再过去吧。\n你还有想问的事对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f8494c9b9ca5ba86e64095e789f7c1dd7ef07cc2d46705eb7bd4ecc3d85d3c6",
      "text": "嗯、嗯！谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0807db2cde3b91d85fc3317acb7bbece3da013dd2ffb2110a41f9f053668ea7d",
      "text": "我在想，万一和弟弟或者妹妹吵架了该怎么办。\n因为经常听朋友这么说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a99fbcabf011604d0c3ad53cbd01f498ff9eab5e63bdf07e37655750daccec5",
      "text": "这样啊。吵起架来的时候，\n确实会觉得可恶、很生气呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28a59ef5322a18ed3ac3b49432f77fc90f132c802ae8445cea917a18c1ccd7cb",
      "text": "可是，正因为吵架，\n有时候反而能明白对方真正的心意哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5808bb4eb355d77f6d6b042fe50993da612366b6cc2492c5e279d3bed72c7bb3",
      "text": "是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8a7178ef718ff77fa7a7954591f2323a7e1ba45ded59354e53c4d85a9ce0cf7",
      "text": "嗯。你们以后要是吵架了一定也会明白的。\n越是吵架，感情就会变得越好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0635cb84eba021bd531fc2312f538a8e9a134cfa912060eb3ded17bf0b7b6a3b",
      "text": "然后，你作为哥哥，\n就能更好地保护弟弟妹妹了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22df0f0f354d962720a8f6814362e291eab269452d37e28b6c385fa90789cf43",
      "text": "能像那样一辈子一起犯傻、一起亲近的，\n就是兄弟和家人啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c95bb68f3592281d71a6a3802434ce6284a7a177b2e5bf1db5c6fc550cf99878",
      "text": "越吵架，感情越好……\n嗯，我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:331f534509821ce6013199e69fa01e871756d7f0b0bec6eeb37495920d489522",
      "text": "虽然听起来很不容易，但为了成为帅气的哥哥，\n我会好好特训的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:073390587dd528e20abac15fff59cb5ddfeaedc30e85d5387a21fbba3f472bf9",
      "text": "就是这个劲头！等小宝宝来到家里之后，\n一定会非常可爱的哦。所以，好好期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:746451dfeb29d82639c1c200cabe067c739a4c5508116d10598f16fc6ce7a7b2",
      "text": "嗯！\n悠介君，谢谢你听我说这些！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b0370e8c93b6b40e604f62c568b7e260c9432f17daebc9bbe1c09c50833ec5f",
      "text": "久等啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d42158a9753cc0f697e856bbc8f808fda1564b822e73bd8b90160a3027adbe2",
      "text": "看你这副表情，\n跟那孩子聊得挺不错嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8f495a9aa0fe9ced823844b56273127d0c6704b3f1478a19f97d1b6d01c47a9",
      "text": "嗯。他说要成为帅气的哥哥，\n干劲十足呢。那孩子的话，一定没问题的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1458a8433b0bbabe4b3bcf8e589482358f170950b74576b380f3e530302a97f7",
      "text": "……话说，我有件事想问享介。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d72a5b33c5033d51fd460a52df8aeaeacf8ed9196e53a15793e4a2e423d7ea9f",
      "text": "你刚才说的，从弟弟的角度看帅气的哥哥，\n具体是指哪种啊？我超级想知道的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:288ab178a2d5ded095b0651c4b6b2dd9aa9af62c366486b30ac7db1ed1f39145",
      "text": "那个啊？就是悠介刚才自己说的那些啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d6b602587cb8fad022e8663e2bb424dbd3f050eaf7a3f2a476f2dfaadfedd8f",
      "text": "弟弟被捉弄或者遇到困难时，\n会赶来帮忙的地方哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3b8d4ac4111230e8af89ceaadd5947bb52b3679bf9fe83a7681ef92ad65faa2",
      "text": "啊～……这样啊！\n原来我一直都做到了啊。嘿嘿……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:913938ee44c546a12be94b7094c9699f311102bf3a77491fff2da91d1bca60a8",
      "text": "以后也拜托你啦，悠介。你要是被捉弄\n或者遇到困难了，我也会去帮你的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:467c7478c0d42737ca1ed60e35a60838b48669b44320faf1b4cce7ef3c6863fa",
      "text": "谢谢你啊。\n我也一直都很依赖你哦，享介。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000126:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71f08d4ec922cf53f49f986bd9ac57226778c47afd1d11271f24cb52135ff9f6",
      "text": "录制辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000128:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eaa5e512f3a3a3f9fa1d99cadc324c7076f34ae8ff970ff9a8b706c3dd3d342",
      "text": "我刚才还在跟享介聊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000130:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec072ea80998974f648726e364dbe36b7a6e3cdc962ab0f6339264f6b5bd975a",
      "text": "因为要有弟弟妹妹出生了，\n就想着要成为帅气的哥哥，\n真可爱啊<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000132:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:792c9d563d7a78795dfa90444d209e4c4beda62de9c36913e1b53c9747fc050f",
      "text": "那么拼命，\n让人忍不住想为他加油呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000134:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09ac02f8e5faa55020f11ee6892f232988ca84ccf8ce7162dcf3b3b2268ff205",
      "text": "那孩子的话，肯定\n能成为一个好哥哥的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000136:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b853fa3ccfb0851ab55734bbf77fad8f0aa259e24abb52a2eafdaef2ab4f0c80",
      "text": "现在就已经足够帅气了呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000138:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4006dcca5e53ba017616cf3b1f8d9b5d7ee1114f932fad613ff90ba03565cdeb",
      "text": "就是说啊！话说回来，\n监督有弟弟或者妹妹吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000140:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5249529fa7f5bf33cc937691e94f168c1af51bca7129164c3fcd2d2bc8aaf369",
      "text": "有哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000140:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74a72fe66379912a84b4aaf5d3b4c13904297f6374c8115fe16a39eb963ccef7",
      "text": "是的，有的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000141:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1540f9ca6ec4d6171e364e561536cb38fc6101b7b693afe4d70057408b4df415",
      "text": "没有呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000141:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12a3c60129d2cc198e2c1fa7a8cbcc3622f8a9b5dfe946ad21b67a6184d64efd",
      "text": "不，没有呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000144:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67dfe7aab478b84b60f6563000f929e5196dab6f43446589b5de76d4d26a13e9",
      "text": "哇，这样啊！\n那和我就一样了呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000148:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ac4b36a930173f96ba94def9e4529fbf07ed9ac016b2b03fa5c941aadf19c46",
      "text": "这样啊。那，\n就和我一样了呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000152:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b46fe57450dada303c664f019eb4aadee5d0e25c5ae89605716caff87bc487f6",
      "text": "为了能让那孩子觉得我们很帅气，\n下次录制我也要加油啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_g:cmd-000154:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96e5ab632f362e960590de0d4ede6581555c0e8b471869e0f4804b4c5f043f3a",
      "text": "嗯，说得对",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da98edabf7f46abb61883012c835156976102749fe6f68a59b071f49693d0c63",
      "text": "下周的录制日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feffe323d966896948ffa124ed0a6e8594fa0a719b4607c479c9f16005ab3594",
      "text": "哟！特训搞得怎么样啦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70cc2caf9f9c2d1ea063d11c88d0ece487c4258dfd1a76ebe7000e2081b071a7",
      "text": "嗯！我一个人也很努力哦！\n昨天也去踢足球了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0898a8485a60748ec617bc8eab1256ff46745b81e5d808bf78545f267e56f440",
      "text": "一个人？爸爸妈妈呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c9206acc046d0d2354a98f6ed80d53f350ee50cefc4b1aee29eee77f24c1a98",
      "text": "他们要工作，还要为刚出生的小宝宝做准备，\n都很忙。而且特训是秘密，所以一个人比较好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bcfbcbbbf01897b5edceeeb7f4d97946f875e45ece30178d8e24262c34ceeaa",
      "text": "这样啊，真的很努力呢。\n你绝对能把足球踢得越来越好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3bd393d9288941d5d1af17ed09757e2e6c14115ecc627e98a755c40ff0dd785",
      "text": "嘿嘿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000068:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aae988d128cdc55eb026d251c9a4439f5e4c7260df5fac8046534db7b003602",
      "text": "彩排结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5261b9b7ab751074878d18f00aca3297409bd8db0e264c85ce132f4ab3d30b7e",
      "text": "让我猜猜悠介现在在想什么。下一个休息日，\n去看看那孩子的情况怎么样～对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fdb23e3bcb2dbe5dbfe06d7bd62ed75010a4d0e52b6a9f9760f260dff4714d6",
      "text": "呃。全被你看穿了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e7163a05483b1d3aad60982c9c0793a76ee2b5b3c6171a64742cb7833e609df",
      "text": "毕竟我都当了悠介这么多年的弟弟了。\n一个人特训这件事，我也稍微有点在意呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62374a3443047d810e19a06cf0d51c34521d3d68e0cf29d5cbb7e7d88928e316",
      "text": "去不动声色地问问他在哪儿特训吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:885ee87bc084681fda3e764ccd11970fbdda57ef7f49aad858a4f49faf6c2cb8",
      "text": "享介……\n嗯，谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8db0363efcdc73d9122a6fc05367a2a76bc135e7655f03fe6a5dbdc7602d8c6",
      "text": "现在的享介对我来说是最好的弟弟，\n但在那孩子眼里，说不定是个很帅气的哥哥呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bd57ef1906e70e1dd9a475e045134540c2e2e18a2b1c094e0c9c1a5c518426d",
      "text": "真想让他也看看啊～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_h:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7806b52f3da002d06e2cf370c6f46b084936da2bb1e5c9401e5e09767f480919",
      "text": "这种话就不用说了啦。\n好啦，录制要开始了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bb0f1354b3a80c02fd784b6c71a7fe37154b51bb3970b4723e198ba09ebc657",
      "text": "下周的休息日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be91b295b8aeef0b243335a33d7632f94f1a3c712a4effb6948e3685dc752e85",
      "text": "应该就在这里才对……啊，在那在那。\n喂——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4100a13ae175b8aeec0b0d5caf58f56536cece0008681bdd0d6f4cab8c8855e1",
      "text": "诶？……哇，是悠介君和享介君！\n你们怎么会在这里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:418a94ccb084707fcab9649b10cbfac4be55847d6164e42530b799f4618224f6",
      "text": "因为想和你一起踢足球呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ade8157a97a7062d08e7e509515c0289b9d7114d856a6b0ac6c197664c6456bf",
      "text": "足球一个人也能踢，\n但大家一起踢不是更好玩吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bb6e8452c6dfdbca6ca785cb908c19f4e6825bd6897a2c0dfb46a944b91f315",
      "text": "而且，我们以前可是足球选手哦。如果是足球\n特训的话，有我们当陪练可是很有帮助的。怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:933e80b26c020357f2c1f4dbbbffa78be435e9b88c9a536b94eb250568c76894",
      "text": "嗯，谢谢！\n请教我踢足球吧。拜托你们了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1611213e6857a40b05f6fd6308ec6e0b905efce301c16bd996f0fd600a7c7a0f",
      "text": "悠介，接球！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f34dec3d6408b7af683fd159b7cead96f508efc3bb72fdf32cbd64827b4b64c5",
      "text": "传得漂亮！看我这一脚直接破门。\n看好咯，来啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8885366ea1e0743af4d47b22bfc2c6e632529b811e09581d8c5b29591638a145",
      "text": "哇啊，太厉害了！\n看得出你们两个感情超级好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:613e49192a80880cddae27930bfad13d42107e6860f2aabba4d56678aecd6202",
      "text": "有家人真好啊。我也想快点见到弟弟或妹妹！\n嘿嘿，好期待啊♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000174:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1a61ea916899385bfcfcee7b29f8931f8377bab33764bb2184a2e15253337b1",
      "text": "喂！\n那个啊，●●●●●●●●●●监督。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000176:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b1022fd49520cac4da18b6a2fff9fd3638a91c521fe8081418962ad88eed961",
      "text": "你还记得前阵子来找我们商量，\n说“想成为帅气的哥哥”的那个孩子吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000178:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e21fab8808785cb70c14f81861ae25a1f5c5f28126575e80a0563254a37aac46",
      "text": "我和享介，\n成了那个孩子的特训支持者哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000180:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0122390d431e91a5afdda804cd02094a9bff52d102c5e85aa0eeea88a9dd54e2",
      "text": "接下来的一段时间里，我们3个人见面的次数可能会变多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000182:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8883f7ffd4469858789413fe2204d3b4d49bed0f136e7f6793ecde97cf0fcd2",
      "text": "那个时候，●●●●●●●●●●监督也\n听到了一点吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000184:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73e01898afdfec52acb7d225cc9a926fe03fcdc9bbceeb3a50aa794f173938e6",
      "text": "所以我和享介商量后，决定还是先跟监督\n交代一下我们正在做的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000186:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20d7cfddff22331f12d488b29918650c211482d2ddcf6647dc203a361080d56b",
      "text": "明白了！谢谢你\n特意联系我",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000189:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28ba86a522e3fb7d68f926d71ad428510e4664c0f354060f950f726a9745a796",
      "text": "嗯，谢谢！\n……啊，享介他们叫我了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_i:cmd-000191:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cce3e44d221079d77d110c1432b3790a0d085b0fa8b133602e3370720e77d80f",
      "text": "那工作加油哦。\n下次录制也拜托啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22cbd56032f0e14d2ad35d0f28e80d691a6b264f6ed64f06515991048440189b",
      "text": "录制最后一天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f8c7c720e90646d898122079a31078759c22d9b051cc18ac510e12e4d06aec6",
      "text": "下一次录制完，体操大哥哥的工作也要结束了啊。\n感觉真是一转眼的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26b87565938accd90846fcf192287c77540e0761be0c681660d48330ebe0d0ff",
      "text": "是啊。要和混熟的大家分别真让人舍不得呢。\n还有那孩子的事也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bcd9ef6a0b7105469a4083226280e3e143fd25abcd6ae1b3607a21ce0f493ec",
      "text": "悠介君、享介君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1cf6f80221e4b48760445d85076fd65812aa90236c5471578459f144b38e78a",
      "text": "噢，怎么啦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d2fabb085800940327d0559020d316d4f8c883136afefeed258b7abc9b1ebc6",
      "text": "今天，爸爸妈妈来看我了哦。\n所以呢，我想把特训的事情也告诉他们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af5190bbf99d1087372b5bd042d3e1d6c3b436aa80b14791d4b819948f49e21a",
      "text": "悠介君和享介君，能跟我一起去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83a6ddbefe5d35df6d8170938a9d946782288c740f77756f4132b1e385dd2066",
      "text": "当然可以了。一起去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52fcc68cd424f829f69777e7020c0daf36d6abd2e8196092450f951f58853cf6",
      "text": "爸爸，妈妈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d4d1b45d240b9b6a7bd45e4b08282e0aed6648e7834916545336fff92987d56",
      "text": "来啦来啦……哎呀？\n苍井先生他们怎么也在一起，发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3911eccd5eae7131ed70507ad6ffacdd2c5cc573154fe5f553f9b17e4f12aba",
      "text": "你们好！今天这孩子有一件很棒的事情，\n想要告诉爸爸和妈妈哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34b2e6517464bbba32436b27be80420897a243811154eb021302c51e3ea6a974",
      "text": "对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14d603348b38c7bfbf5df2138a47f29a4c0466f1715712bd40660e6bc46ebb70",
      "text": "我啊，和W一起进行了足球特训哦。为了成为帅气的\n哥哥，我一个人也有好好努力呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:210bc6972e95d42b7c36061782b84164a890046a6ba8b49ede7f5c502a82b7ad",
      "text": "等小宝宝来到家里，我会保护他的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_j:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70250ffbd98e334c792ca3ba345a16b7ad437b9e3d46fe2bbe8522ce2717cd13",
      "text": "这样啊……谢谢你。没想到这么短的时间里，\n你已经完全变成了一个可靠的哥哥呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_k:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b70fb4cbc13589c0561b479d48ca481ae88aed7ce9e0ae094fdc91f198f554b",
      "text": "正式录制……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_k:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:678691f4a27eac0fbb08f8edb1fa3295dcb8c557102fd096d61548404b27baea",
      "text": "现在要公布在《VIVA!!家庭律动》里每次都会做的、\n最后的定点姿势的主题啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_k:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a79d42d2e6e4e4dc9022a9ee456e7458de346aeb7b6ab25975ab87c9ef3e5866",
      "text": "今天希望大家能摆出\n自己觉得最帅气的姿势。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_k:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f09b0b984f954d3b22452b6fdca66210e853ad44d320713dbeb20518f570dae2",
      "text": "把大家最帅气的模样，展现给我们看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_k:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:104ecbfa10cb1eb820d2efe7b03ce463b6290fc695fe2a6ccedcc6c3cd60d1e4",
      "text": "帅气的姿势啊～\n要摆什么样的好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_k:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff38f9bcb886da128687197ab2bc899a489776457bd28532a0f1a2f1bead568b",
      "text": "我要摆那个姿势！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_k:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eb2631aa3a02f52a2c12a3bcd1b9b9f6a8c7bf965110fed587a972fdf2efcc0",
      "text": "还有，前来观看的爸爸妈妈们，\n也一起来跳吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_k:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f91aaa3ed135634a955046390a54ee5a04242914fc2ab3c07969048ffa2d5cc2",
      "text": "当然，电视机前的各位也是哦。\n只要一起跳，大家就都是W大家庭的一员啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_k:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:867c4a2876cdfcd5cd2849315fb2719361423d01a261e7e2f9b074024aadc587",
      "text": "那么，准备好了吗？\n要开始咯！预备——",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_k:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f61604be84737e5a932dbd52fdee12364ac69adc66a38ec45b73be3d7b02dbe2",
      "text": "音乐开始！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
